  "title": "Serial vs Parallel",
  "parentId": "sec-pp-work",
  "hidden": false,
  "markdown": "#### Serial vs Parallel\n\nProgram → 多项 Work；存在前后 Dependency 的操作 → 按依赖顺序执行（Serial）；Independent Work → Parallelizable（可并行）≠ Parallel Execution（实际并行）；真正使用多个 Core 并行，还要看硬件资源和 Overhead 是否值得",
